d-80cc-ee22756ab189","name":"Pultz, Christina Juul","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Thea Mundt","key":"lohsepau","last":"Lohse","locid":"060bd03d-6c60-4375-8628-6b6e64e2523d","name":"Lohse, Thea Mundt","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Just Bendix","key":"justesenpau","last":"Justesen","locid":"63b3e1bb-0ebb-484c-96a2-202ee02a884f","name":"Justesen, Just Bendix","orcid":"0000-0003-4806-1147","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Charlotte Ahlgren","key":"særvollpau","last":"Særvoll","name":"Særvoll, Charlotte Ahlgren","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Sofie Fønsskov","key":"møllerpau","last":"Møller","name":"Møller, Sofie Fønsskov","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3 2","first":"Birgitte","key":"lindegaardpau","last":"Lindegaard","locid":"f8c3a235-1f94-4c1d-afe3-c6c7f9b31002","name":"Lindegaard, Birgitte","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2 3","first":"Thea K.","key":"fischerpau","last":"Fischer","locid":"97c4bf8d-8bd1-470b-8e0b-91eb4faf7703","name":"Fischer, Thea K.","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 4","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Tina","key":"dalagerpau","last":"Dalager","locid":"aab2a456-94b2-4593-9464-30ee75b65c87","name":"Dalager, Tina","orcid":"0000-0002-6632-7001","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2 3","first":"Stig","key":"molstedpau","last":"Molsted","locid":"05ca8142-78a6-4564-8d6f-ac2e4a5fb9b6","name":"Molsted, Stig","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["37998316"],"pub":{"doi":"10.3390/ijerph20227085","issn":["16604601","16617827"],"issn_org":["16617827"],"issue":"22","journal":"International Journal of Environmental Research and Public Health","paperid":"7085","publisher":"Multidisciplinary Digital Publishing Institute (MDPI)","status":"p","title":"International Journal of Environmental Research and Public Health","volume":"20"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85177816737"],